?url=%2Fimages%2Flogo.png&amp;w=96&amp;q=75 2x\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flogo.png&amp;w=96&amp;q=75\"/></a><nav aria-label=\"Primary\" class=\"hidden items-center gap-7 lg:flex xl:gap-9\"><div class=\"relative\"><a class=\"relative flex items-center gap-2 py-2 transition-colors text-muted hover:text-ink\" href=\"/\">Home</a></div><div class=\"relative\"><a aria-current=\"page\" class=\"relative flex items-center gap-2 py-2 transition-colors font-semibold text-ink\" href=\"/about\">About</a></div><div class=\"relative\"><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-haspopup=\"true\" aria-label=\"Companies submenu\" class=\"relative flex items-center gap-2 py-2 transition-colors text-muted hover:text-ink\">Companies<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0 text-muted transition-transform duration-200\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button><div class=\"fixed top-20 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 z-[60] w-full max-w-[900px] rounded-lg border border-line bg-white shadow-overlay opacity-0 -translate-y-2 pointer-events-none ease-in transition-transform duration-200\"><div class=\"page-container flex flex-col gap-0 p-6 lg:p-8\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1\"><span class=\"label-caps text-muted\">Operating subsidiaries</span><h2 class=\"text-headline-md font-bold tracking-tight text-ink\">Our companies</h2><p class=\"mt-1 text-body-sm leading-relaxed text-muted\">Four distinct enterprises driving modernisation across key economic sectors.</p></div><div class=\"mt-6 grid grid-cols-1 gap-0 md:grid-cols-2 border-t border-line pt-6\"><a class=\"flex items-center gap-4 border-b border-line/60 py-4 px-2 transition-colors hover:bg-surface/50 hover:text-accent focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-accent/20 focus:bg-surface/50 last:border-b-0\" href=\"/companies/jallal-tech\"><div class=\"flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-surface text-accent\"><svg class=\"h-5 w-5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" d=\"M12 6V4m0 2a2 2 0 100 4m0-4a2 2 0 110 4m-6 8a2 2 0 100-4m0 4a2 2 0 110-4m0 4v2m0-6V4m6 6v10m6-2a2 2 0 100-4m0 4a2 2 0 110-4m0 4v2m0-6V4\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"flex flex-col min-w-0\"><span class=\"font-semibold text-ink truncate\">Jallal Tech</span><span class=\"text-label-sm text-muted truncate\">Enterprise IT, software engineering and data infrastructure</span></div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a><a class=\"flex items-center gap-4 border-b border-line/60 py-4 px-2 transition-colors hover:bg-surface/50 hover:text-accent focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-accent/20 focus:bg-surface/50 last:border-b-0\" href=\"/companies/elevate-360\"><div class=\"flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-surface text-accent\"><svg class=\"h-5 w-5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" d=\"M14 7l7 7m0 0-7 7m7-7-3-3M3 16l3-3m0 0-3 3m3-3-3-3\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"flex flex-col min-w-0\"><span class=\"font-semibold text-ink truncate\">Elevate 360</span><span class=\"text-label-sm text-muted truncate\">Business growth, operational scaling and digital presence</span></div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 2