 stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a><a class=\"flex items-center gap-4 border-b border-line/60 py-4 px-2 transition-colors hover:bg-surface/50 hover:text-accent focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-accent/20 focus:bg-surface/50 last:border-b-0\" href=\"/companies/jallal-properties-group\"><div class=\"flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-surface text-accent\"><svg class=\"h-5 w-5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" d=\"M19.428 15.428a2 2 0 00-1.022-.547l-2.384-.477a6 6 0 00-3.86.517l-.318.158a6 6 0 01-3.86.517L6.05 15.21a2 2 0 00-1.806.547M8 4h8l-1 1v5.172a2 2 0 00.586 1.414l5 5c1.26 1.26.367 3.414-1.415 3.414H4.828c-1.782 0-2.674-2.154-1.414-3.414l5-5A2 2 0 009 10.172V5L8 4z\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"flex flex-col min-w-0\"><span class=\"font-semibold text-ink truncate\">Jallal Properties Group</span><span class=\"text-label-sm text-muted truncate\">Real estate, land diligence and commercial property</span></div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div><div class=\"mt-6 flex items-center gap-2 border-t border-line pt-4\"><span class=\"text-body-sm text-muted\">View all subsidiaries</span><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-body-sm font-semibold text-ink transition-colors hover:text-accent\" href=\"/companies\">Explore portfolio<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-3.5 w-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div></div></div><div class=\"relative\"><a class=\"relative flex items-center gap-2 py-2 transition-colors text-muted hover:text-ink\" href=\"/digital-ventures\">Digital Ventures</a></div><div class=\"relative\"><a class=\"relative flex items-center gap-2 py-2 transition-colors text-muted hover:text-ink\" href=\"/partnerships\">Partnerships</a></div></nav><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><a class=\"items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-md font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-[11px] leading-4 transition-all duration-200 disabled:opacity-60 disabled:pointer-events-none whitespace-nowrap bg-ink text-white hover:bg-forest shadow-sm hover:shadow-raised h-9 px-4 hidden sm:inline-flex btn-press\" href=\"/partnerships#inquiry\">Partner with us</a><a title=\"Team login\" aria-label=\"Team login\" class=\"hidden h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-ink text-white transition-colors hover:bg-forest sm:flex focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-accent/20\" href=\"/admin/login\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg></a><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"mobile-navigation\" aria-label=\"Open menu\" class=\"flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-md border border-line text-ink transition-colors hover:bg-sunken lg:hidden focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-accent/20\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-menu h-5 w-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 5h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 12h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 19h16\"></path></svg></button></div></div></header><main id=\"main-content\" class=\"flex-1 pt-20\"><section class=\"relative overflow-hidden border-b border-line bg-white\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"surface-grid pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 opacity-40\"></div><div class=\"page-container relative py-14 lg:py-20\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-10 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-12\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-5 lg:col-span-7\"><span class=\"label-caps inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-accent\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"h-px w-6 bg-accent\"></span>About Jallal Group</span><h1 class=\"text-display-md font-bold tracking-tight text-ink sm:text-display-lg\">A group built on vision, discipline and innovation.</h1><p class=\"max-w-2xl text-body-lg leading-relaxed text-muted\">Jallal Group is a diversified business group based in Bo, Sierra Leone. We build companies and platforms across technology, business development, education, real estate and digital ventures — each designed to create lasting value at home and across the region.</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-3 pt-1\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-md font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-[11px] leading-4 transition-all duration-200 disabled:opacity-60 disabled:pointer-events-none whitespace-nowrap bg-ink text-white hover:bg-forest shadow-sm hover:shadow-raised h-11 px-6\" href=\"/our-companies\">Our companies<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a><a class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-md font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-[11px] leading-4 transition-all duration-200 disabled:opacity-60 disabled:pointer-events-none whitespace-nowrap bg-white text-ink border border-line hover:border-ink hover:bg-sunken h-11 px-6\" href=\"/partnerships#inquiry\">Partner with us</a></div></div><dl class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-6 self-end lg:col-span-5 lg:grid-cols-2\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1 rounded-lg border border-line bg-surface p-5\"><dd class=\"order-1 text-headline-md font-bold text-ink\">2021</dd><dt class=\"order-2 label-caps text-muted\">Founded in Bo</dt></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1 rounded-lg border border-line bg-surface p-5\"><dd class=\"order-1 text-headline-md font-bold text-ink\">04</dd><dt class=\"order-2 label-caps text-muted\">Operating companies</dt></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1 rounded-lg border border-line bg-surface p-5\"><dd class=\"order-1 text-headline-md font-bold text-ink\">03</dd><dt class=\"order-2 label-caps text-muted\">Digital ventures</dt></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1 rounded-lg border border-line bg-surface p-5\"><dd class=\"order-1 text-headline-md font-bold text-ink\">1,200+</dd><dt class=\"order-2 label-caps text-muted\">Graduates trained</dt></div></dl></div></div></section><section class=\"border-b border-line bg-surface py-16 lg:py-24\"><div class=\"page-container\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 items-center gap-10 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-14\"><div class=\"lg:col-span-6\"><div class=\"rounded-lg border border-line bg-white p-2 shadow-card\"><div class=\"relative aspect-[16/10] overflow-hidden rounded\"><img alt=\"Jallal Group product and engineering team reviewing system architecture\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"(min-width: 1024px) 50vw, 100vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fventures-studio.jpg&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fventures-studio.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fventures-studio.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fventures-studio.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fventures-studio.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fventures-studio.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fventures-studio.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fventures-studio.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fventures-studio.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fventures-studio.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-5 lg:col-span-6\"><span class=\"label-caps inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-accent\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"h-px w-6 bg-accent\"></span>Our story</span><h2 class=\"text-display-md font-bold tracking-tight text-ink lg:text-display-lg\">Grounded in Sierra Leone. Built for scale.</h2><p class=\"text-body-lg leading-relaxed text-muted\">Jallal Group began with a simple observation: the most durable businesses in emerging markets are the ones that solve structural problems with local insight and world-class execution. We started in software, and expanded deliberately — into education that feeds our engineering pipeline, growth services that commercialise products, property that anchors real assets, and ventures that modernise everyday systems.</p><p class=\"text-body-md leading-relaxed text-muted\">Today the group operates as a group structure with shared technology, governance and capital discipline. Each subsidiary runs with dedicated leadership and clear accountability, while drawing on the group&#x27;s common infrastructure.</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"border-b border-line bg-forest py-16 text-white lg:py-24\"><div class=\"page-container\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 lg:grid-cols-2\"><article class=\"rounded-lg border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.04] p-7 lg:p-9\"><span class=\"label-caps text-lime\">Our vision</span><h2 class=\"mt-3 text-headline-lg font-bold tracking-tight text-white\">A sovereign, technology-driven economy for Sierra Leone and West Africa.</h2><p class=\"mt-4 text-body-md leading-relaxed text-on-dark-muted\">We envision an ecosystem where local talent builds the infrastructure its own society depends on — where payments, mobility, property and enterprise software are engineered here, governed properly, and scaled responsibly.</p></article><article class=\"rounded-lg border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.04] p-7 lg:p-9\"><span class=\"label-caps text-lime\">Our mission</span><h2 class=\"mt-3 text-headline-lg font-bold tracking-tight text-white\">Build companies that outlast us and opportunities that outgrow us.</h2><p class=\"mt-4 text-body-md leading-relaxed text-on-dark-muted\">We establish and grow operating businesses with disciplined governance, invest in technical education, and incubate digital ventures that remove friction from everyday economic life — creating employment, capability and compounding value.</p></article></div></div></section><section class=\"border-b border-line bg-white py-16 lg:py-24\"><div class=\"page-container\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-6 lg:flex-row lg:items-end lg:justify-between\"><div class=\"flex max-w-3xl flex-col gap-4\"><span class=\"label-caps inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-accent\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"h-px w-6 bg-accent\"></span>Core values</span><h2 class=\"font-bold tracking-tight lg:text-display-lg text-ink\">The principles behind every decision.</h2><p class=\"max-w-2xl leading-relaxed text-muted\">Shared operating values that apply equally to our subsidiaries, our ventures and our partnerships.</p></div></div><div class=\"mt-10 grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4\"><article class=\"rounded-lg border border-line bg-surface p-6 transition-colors hover:border-line-strong\"><span class=\"flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-white text-accent\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check h-5 w-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg></span><h3 class=\"mt-4 text-title-md font-semibold text-ink\">Integrity</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-body-sm leading-relaxed text-muted\">Fiduciary transparency and disciplined governance in every entity, partnership and transaction.</p></article><article class=\"rounded-lg border border-line bg-surface p-6 transition-colors hover:border-line-strong\"><span class=\"flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-white text-accent\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-terminal h-5 w-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 19h8\"></path><path d=\"m4 17 6-6-6-6\"></path></svg></span><h3 class=\"mt-4 text-title-md font-semibold text-ink\">Engineering rigour</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-body-sm leading-relaxed text-muted\">Solutions are architected for real operating conditions — low bandwidth, intermittent power, high stakes.</p></article><article class=\"rounded-lg border border-line bg-surface p-6 transition-colors hover:border-line-strong\"><span class=\"flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-white text-accent\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-users h-5 w-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><path d=\"M16 3.128a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.744\"></path><path d=\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle></svg></span><h3 class=\"mt-4 text-title-md font-semibold text-ink\">People first</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-body-sm leading-relaxed text-muted\">We invest in local technical talent so growth compounds inside the communities we serve.</p></article><article class=\"rounded-lg border border-line bg-surface p-6 transition-colors hover:border-line-strong\"><span class=\"flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-white text-accent\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-globe h-5 w-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 2a14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0 20 14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0-20\"></path><path d=\"M2 12h20\"></path></svg></span><h3 class=\"mt-4 text-title-md font-semibold text-ink\">Long-term horizon</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-body-sm leading-relaxed text-muted\">We build for durable value and sovereign capability, not short-term extraction.</p></article></div></div></section><section class=\"border-b border-line bg-surface py-16 lg:py-24\"><div class=\"page-container\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-6 lg:flex-row lg:items-end lg:justify-between\"><div class=\"flex max-w-3xl flex-col gap-4\"><span class=\"label-caps inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-accent\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"h-px w-6 bg-accent\"></span>Focus areas</span><h2 class=\"font-bold tracking-tight lg:text-display-lg text-ink\">Where we operate.</h2><p class=\"max-w-2xl leading-relaxed text-muted\">Five reinforcing areas of activity, coordinated through a single group structure.</p></div></div><div class=\"mt-10 grid grid-cols-1 gap-px overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-line bg-line md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-5\"><div class=\"flex flex-col bg-white p-6\"><span class=\"label-caps text-muted\">01</span><h3 class=\"mt-3 text-title-md font-semibold text-ink\">Technology</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-body-sm leading-relaxed text-muted\">Software development, enterprise IT, data infrastructure and digital solutions for public and private institutions.</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-col bg-white p-6\"><span class=\"label-caps text-muted\">02</span><h3 class=\"mt-3 text-title-md font-semibold text-ink\">Business development</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-body-sm leading-relaxed text-muted\">Operational scaling, digital presence and commercial acceleration for growing African enterprises.</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-col bg-white p-6\"><span class=\"label-caps text-muted\">03</span><h3 class=\"mt-3 text-title-md font-semibold text-ink\">Education</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-body-sm leading-relaxed text-muted\">Technical training and digital skills development that build the next generation of West African engineers.</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-col bg-white p-6\"><span class=\"label-caps text-muted\">04</span><h3 class=\"mt-3 text-title-md font-semibold text-ink\">Real estate</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-body-sm leading-relaxed text-muted\">Property services, land diligence and asset development across Sierra Leone&#x27;s high-growth corridors.</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-col bg-white p-6\"><span class=\"label-caps text-muted\">05</span><h3 class=\"mt-3 text-title-md font-semibold text-ink\">Digital ventures</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-body-sm leading-relaxed text-muted\">Proprietary platforms in payments, mobility and property — incubated, prototyped and shipped in-house.</p></div></div><div class=\"mt-10 grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 md:grid-cols-2\"><div class=\"rounded-lg border border-line bg-white p-6\"><span class=\"label-caps text-accent\">Operating companies</span><ul class=\"mt-4 flex flex-col gap-3\"><li><a href=\"/companies/jallal-tech\" class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4 border-b border-line pb-3 text-body-md font-medium text-ink transition-colors hover:text-accent\">Jallal Tech<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 text-muted\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></li><li><a href=\"/companies/elevate-360\" class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4 border-b border-line pb-3 text-body-md font-medium text-ink transition-colors hover:text-accent\">Elevate 360<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 text-muted\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></li><li><a href=\"/companies/jallal-institute-of-technology\" class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4 border-b border-line pb-3 text-body-md font-medium text-ink transition-colors hover:text-accent\">Jallal Institute of Technology<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 text-muted\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></li><li><a href=\"/companies/jallal-properties-group\" class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4 border-b border-line pb-3 text-body-md font-medium text-ink transition-colors hover:text-accent\">Jallal Properties Group<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 text-muted\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></li></ul></div><div class=\"rounded-lg border border-line bg-white p-6\"><span class=\"label-caps text-accent\">Digital ventures</span><ul class=\"mt-4 flex flex-col gap-3\"><li><a href=\"/digital-ventures#jallal-pay\" class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4 border-b border-line pb-3 text-body-md font-medium text-ink transition-colors hover:text-accent\">Jallal Pay<span class=\"text-body-sm text-muted\">In development</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/digital-ventures#waka-salone\" class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4 border-b border-line pb-3 text-body-md font-medium text-ink transition-colors hover:text-accent\">Waka Salone<span class=\"text-body-sm text-muted\">Prototyping</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/digital-ventures#first-home\" class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4 border-b border-line pb-3 text-body-md font-medium text-ink transition-colors hover:text-accent\">First Home<span class=\"text-body-sm text-muted\">Architecture</span></a></li></ul></div></div></div></section><section class=\"bg-forest py-16 text-white lg:py-24\"><div class=\"page-container\"><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center rounded-lg border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.04] px-6 py-12 text-center shadow-overlay md:px-12 lg:px-16 lg:py-16\"><span class=\"label-caps text-lime\">Work with us</span><h2 class=\"mt-3 max-w-3xl text-display-md font-bold tracking-tight text-white lg:text-display-lg\">Build the next chapter with Jallal Group.</h2><p class=\"mt-5 max-w-2xl text-body-lg leading-relaxed text-on-dark-muted\">Whether you are an institution, an investor, an enterprise or a partner with regional ambition, we would like to hear from you.</p><div class=\"mt-8 flex w-full flex-col justify-center gap-3 sm:w-auto sm:flex-row\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-md font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-[11px] leading-4 transition-all duration-200 disabled:opacity-60 disabled:pointer-events-none whitespace-nowrap bg-lime text-ink hover:bg-accent hover:text-white h-12 px-7\" href=\"/partnerships#inquiry\">Partner with us</a><a class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-md font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-[11px] leading-4 transition-all duration-200 disabled:opacity-60 disabled:pointer-events-none whitespace-nowrap shadow-sm hover:shadow-raised h-12 px-7 border border-white/20 bg-transparent text-white hover:bg-white hover:text-ink\" href=\"/our-companies\">Explore our companies</a></div><div class=\"mt-10 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-x-8 gap-y-3 border-t border-white/10 pt-6 text-body-sm text-on-dark-muted\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin h-4 w-4 text-lime\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg>Bo, Sierra Leone</span><a href=\"mailto:partnerships@jallalgroup.com\" class=\"flex items-center gap-2 transition-colors hover:text-white\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-mail h-4 w-4 text-lime\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m22 7-8.991 5.727a2 2 0 0 1-2.009 0L2 7\"></path><rect x=\"2\" y=\"4\" width=\"20\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\"></rect></svg>partnerships@jallalgroup.com</a><span class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clock h-4 w-4 text-lime\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 6v6l4 2\"></path></svg>Mon–Fri · 08:30–17:30 GMT</span></div></div></div></section><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"border-t border-white/10 bg-forest text-white\"><div class=\"page-container pb-8 pt-16\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-10 border-b border-white/10 pb-12 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-8\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4 lg:col-span-4\"><a class=\"flex items-center gap-4\" href=\"/\"><img alt=\"Jallal Group\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"h-16 w-16 object-contain\" style=\"color:transparent\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flogo.png&amp;w=64&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flogo.png&amp;w=128&amp;q=75 2x\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flogo.png&amp;w=128&amp;q=75\"/></a><div data-scroll-reveal=\"0\" style=\"transition-delay:0s;opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px);transition:opacity 0s ease-out 0s, transform 0s ease-out 0s\"><p class=\"max-w-sm text-body-sm leading-relaxed text-on-dark-muted\">A diversified, technology-driven business group building companies, digital platforms and innovative solutions for emerging markets across Sierra Leone and beyond.</p></div><div data-scroll-reveal=\"0.1\" style=\"transition-delay:0.1s;opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px);transition:opacity 0s ease-out 0.1s, transform 0s ease-out 0.1s\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 self-start rounded-md border border-white/10 bg-white/5 px-3 py-1.5\"><span class=\"relative flex h-2 w-2\"><span class=\"absolute inline-flex h-full w-full animate-ping rounded-full bg-lime opacity-60\"></span><span class=\"relative inline-flex h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-lime\"></span></span><span class=\"label-caps text-on-dark\">HQ · Bo, Sierra Leone</span></div></div></div><div data-scroll-reveal=\"0.1\" style=\"transition-delay:0.1s;opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px);transition:opacity 0s ease-out 0.1s, transform 0s ease-out 0.1s\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3 lg:col-span-2\"><h3 class=\"label-caps text-lime\">Overview</h3><ul class=\"flex flex-col gap-2.5 text-body-sm text-on-dark-muted\"><li><a class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 transition-colors hover:text-white hover:pl-1\" href=\"/\">Home<span class=\"h-px w-px bg-lime transition-all group-hover:w-2\"></span></a></li><li><a class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 transition-colors hover:text-white hover:pl-1\" href=\"/about\">About Jallal Group<span class=\"h-px w-px bg-lime transition-all group-hover:w-2\"></span></a></li><li><a class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 transition-colors hover:text-white hover:pl-1\" href=\"/our-companies\">Companies<span class=\"h-px w-px bg-lime transition-all group-hover:w-2\"></span></a></li><li><a class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 transition-colors hover:text-white hover:pl-1\" href=\"/digital-ventures\">Digital Ventures<span class=\"h-px w-px bg-lime transition-all group-hover:w-2\"></span></a></li></ul></div></div><div data-scroll-reveal=\"0.1\" style=\"transition-delay:0.1s;opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px);transition:opacity 0s ease-out 0.1s, transform 0s ease-out 0.1s\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3 lg:col-span-2\"><h3 class=\"label-caps text-lime\">Portfolio</h3><ul class=\"flex flex-col gap-2.5 text-body-sm text-on-dark-muted\"><li><a class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 transition-colors hover:text-white hover:pl-1\" href=\"/companies/jallal-tech\">Jallal Tech<span class=\"h-px w-px bg