ommon infrastructure.\"}]]}]\n10:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"border-b border-line bg-forest py-16 text-white lg:py-24\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"page-container\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 lg:grid-cols-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"article\",null,{\"className\":\"rounded-lg border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.04] p-7 lg:p-9\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"label-caps text-lime\",\"children\":\"Our vision\"}],[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-headline-lg font-bold tracking-tight text-white\",\"children\":\"A sovereign, technology-driven economy for Sierra Leone and West Africa.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-4 text-body-md leading-relaxed text-on-dark-muted\",\"children\":\"We envision an ecosystem where local talent builds the infrastructure its own society depends on — where payments, mobility, property and enterprise software are engineered here, governed properly, and scaled responsibly.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"article\",null,{\"className\":\"rounded-lg border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.04] p-7 lg:p-9\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"label-caps text-lime\",\"children\":\"Our mission\"}],[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-headline-lg font-bold tracking-tight text-white\",\"children\":\"Build companies that outlast us and opportunities that outgrow us.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-4 text-body-md leading-relaxed text-on-dark-muted\",\"children\":\"We establish and grow operating businesses with disciplined governance, invest in technical education, and incubate digital ventures that remove friction from everyday economic life — creating employment, capability and compounding value.\"}]]}]]}]}]}]\n11:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"border-b border-line bg-white py-16 lg:py-24\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"page-container\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex 